on><graphic xlink:href="1472-6947-7-5-3"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F4"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p><bold>Daily Access to NLM Server</bold>. Number of hits to NLM server from Monday to Friday during the study period</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1472-6947-7-5-4"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F5"><label>Figure 5</label><caption><p><bold>Hourly Access to NLM Server</bold>. Number of hits to NLM server hourly from 8 am to 4 pm during the study period</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1472-6947-7-5-5"/></fig><table-wrap position="float" id="T1"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Pre-study survey. Proportion of the Internet access by location.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td align="left"><bold>Internet Access</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>PostPGY1 (n = 36) %</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>Interns (n = 24) %</bold></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">Home</td><td align="center">45%</td><td align="center">68%</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Hospital &#x02013; Office</td><td align="center">55%</td><td align="center">32%</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Desktop</td><td align="center">91%</td><td align="center">85%</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Mobile Computer</td><td align="center">9%</td><td align="center">15%</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T2"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Pre-study survey. Daily Internet usage.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td align="left"><bold>Daily Internet Usage</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>PostPGY1 (n = 36) n (%)</bold></td><td align="center"><bold>Interns (n = 21) n (%)</bold></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">&#x0003c;5 times/day</td><td align="center">19 (53%)</td><td align="center">12 (57%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">5&#x02013;10 times/day</td><td align="center">14 (39%)</td><td align="center">7 (33%)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x0003e; 10 times/day</td><td align="center">3 (8%)</t